Z||000001||terryk||04-17-2001||01:21 AM||||Iron heads? About $400 each. Around $500 list. DOHC heads? About $600.<P>GM PN 14054884<P>345664 Engine, Cylinder Head & Valves, Cylinder Head, 3.4L  List $504.00 $393.12 <P>Same head as the 2.8L Z, 9, W and S engines and 3.1L TBI. Maybe some otherss. Pretty generic head. Just don't use the older X engine head. Smaller valves.<p>[This message has been edited by terryk (edited 04-17-2001).]||||reg||1
